    LLM: "Lead any card. Win by playing SAME RANK as led card (last match wins). Seven = WILD (matches any led). 'Greasing': winner can extend trick by leading again. A=10pts, 10=10pts. Total=80. 40+ wins. Tie: last trick winner wins.",
